<p>NobodyWho Chat collects no personal data. All AI processing happens on your device. We have no servers, no accounts,
    and no analytics. Your conversations stay on your device. The only exceptions are the optional online features
    you choose to use (web search and online tools), which send a short request to a third-party service, and
    anonymous diagnostics, all described in detail below.</p>
<h2>1. Who we are</h2>
<p>NobodyWho Chat is developed and distributed by NobodyWho. NobodyWho is an inference engine that lets you run LLMs
    locally and efficiently on any device.</p>
<p>This Privacy Policy applies solely to the NobodyWho Chat application available on the Apple App Store (iOS) and the
    Google Play Store (Android). It does not apply to any other products or services we may offer.</p>
