<p>These services act independently, not on our behalf, and we receive nothing back from them other than the
    requested content.</p>
<p>We do not sell, rent, license, or trade any user data.</p>
<h2>6. Children's privacy</h2>
<p>NobodyWho Chat does not knowingly collect any personal information from anyone, including children under the age of
    13 (or the applicable age in your jurisdiction). Since we collect no personal data, no special handling is required —
    though parents should be aware that, like any general-purpose AI assistant, the app's outputs may occasionally be
    unsuitable for young children, and web search results come from the open web.</p>
<h2>7. Security</h2>
<p>Because your conversation data never leaves your device, traditional concerns about server-side data breaches,
    unauthorized access, or data interception in transit do not apply to your prompts and messages. Web search queries and
    online tool requests are sent over encrypted (HTTPS) connections. Pages from the websites in search results are
    downloaded using the connection type the website provides.</p>
<p>Data stored on your device (such as saved conversations) is protected by your platform's on-device encryption and is
    subject to your device's passcode and biometric protections. We encourage you to keep your device updated with the
    latest software.</p>
<h2>8. Your rights</h2>
<p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights including access, correction, deletion, or portability of
    personal data. Because NobodyWho Chat holds no personal data about you on any server, and diagnostic reports are
    anonymous and cannot be tied to you, there is nothing personally identifying for us to provide, correct, or delete on
    our end. For requests sent to a search engine, website, or online tool service, please refer to that service's privacy
    policy.</p>
<p>Any conversations or data stored locally on your device can be deleted from within the app, by uninstalling the app
    from your device, or by clearing app data through your device's settings. This is entirely within your control.</p>
<h2>9. Data retention</h2>
<p>We retain no personal user data. Any conversations stored on-device persist only as long as you choose to keep them,
    and uninstalling the app removes all app data from your device. Anonymous diagnostics are retained by Sentry
    according to its standard retention schedule and are used only to diagnose stability and performance issues.</p>
<h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date at the top of
    this page. If we ever make material changes — particularly any change that would result in us collecting data that we
    currently do not — we will notify you prominently within the app.</p>
<p>Your continued use of NobodyWho Chat after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
